      "id": "d2cb93ee60c6-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "Select the related letters/numbers from the given alternatives. CARD : 18 : : SORT : ?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Select the related letters/numbers from the given alternatives.</p>\n<strong>CARD : 18 : : SORT : ?</strong>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1",
          "html": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "6",
          "html": "6"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "4",
          "html": "4"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "5",
          "html": "5"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>Consider the English alphabet series to gauge the numerical value of letters.​</p>\n\n<p>The pattern followed here is:</p>\n\n<p>Take the sum of (first and second letter) and (third and fourth letter), then subtract both sums.</p>\n\n<p>C = 3, A = 1, 3 + 1 = 4;</p>\n\n<p>R = 18, D = 4, 18 + 4 = 22</p>\n\n<p>→ 22 – 4 = 18</p>\n\n<p>Same pattern will be followed for ‘<strong>SORT : ?</strong><strong>’.</strong></p>\n\n<p>S = 19, O = 15, 19 + 15 = 34</p>\n\n<p>R = 18, T = 20, 18 + 20 = 38</p>\n\n<p>→ 38 – 34 = 4</p>\nHence, ‘4’ is the correct alternative.",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
