      "question": "Select the related term from the given alternatives.. DAM : 17 :: SPA : 305 :: SIT : ?",
      "questionHtml": "<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\" \">Select the related term from the given alternatives..<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\" \">DAM : 17&nbsp;:: SPA&nbsp;: 305&nbsp;</span>:: SIT&nbsp;:&nbsp;<span style=\" \">?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "186",
          "html": "186"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "125",
          "html": "125"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "163",
          "html": "163"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "191",
          "html": "191"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\" \">The alphabet table with corresponding positional value is given below:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 7.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/05/Common_Diagram_28.01.2020_D1.png\" style=\"width: 536px; height: 128px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>The<strong>&nbsp;logic</strong> applied here is: <strong>Number = Positional values of ( I<sup>st</sup>&nbsp;letter&nbsp;&times; II<sup>nd</sup>&nbsp;letter + III<sup>rd</sup>&nbsp;letter )</strong></p>\n\n<p>Checking the logic in given pairs:</p>\n\n<p><u>DAM</u></p>\n\n<p>D = 4</p>\n\n<p>A = 1</p>\n\n<p>M = 13</p>\n\n<p>Then Number = 4&nbsp;&times; 1 + 13 = 4 + 13 = 17.</p>\n\n<p><u>SPA</u></p>\n\n<p>S = 19</p>\n\n<p>P = 16</p>\n\n<p>A = 1</p>\n\n<p>Then Number = 19&nbsp;&times; 16 + 1 = 304 + 1 = 305.</p>\n\n<p>Similarly, applying the same logic in SIT, we have:</p>\n\n<p><u>SIT</u></p>\n\n<p>S = 19</p>\n\n<p>I = 9</p>\n\n<p>T = 20</p>\n\n<p>Then Number = 19&nbsp;&times; 9 + 20&nbsp;= 171 + 20 = 191</p>\n\n<p>Thus <strong>SIT : 191.</strong></p>\n\n<p>Hence <strong>&#39;191&#39; </strong>is the correct answer.</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/05/Common_Diagram_28.01.2020_D1.png"
      ],
