      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/quesImage859.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>The pattern followed here is,</p>\n\n<p>Logic: The number is the cube of the sum of the positional value of both the letters.</p>\n\n<p>GB = (7 + 2)<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;= 9<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;= 729</p>\n\n<p>Similarly, we have:</p>\n\n<p>AS =&nbsp;(1&nbsp;+ 19)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;= 20<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3</span>&nbsp;= 8000</p>\n\n<p>Hence, <strong>8000 </strong>is the correct answer.</p>\n",
