      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>As per the English alphabetical series,</p>\n\n<p>Positional value of X = 24, 24 &ndash; 7 = 17</p>\n\n<p>Positional value of I = 9, 9 &ndash; 7 = 2</p>\n\n<p>Positional value of G = 7</p>\n\n<p>Positional value of P = 16</p>\n\n<p>Similarly,</p>\n\n<p>Positional value of Z = 26, 26 &ndash; 7 = 19</p>\n\n<p>Positional value of H = 8, 8 &ndash; 7 = 1</p>\n\n<p>Positional value of E = 5</p>\n\n<p>Positional value of J = 10</p>\n\n<p>Thus code for ZHEJ is 191510.</p>\n",
