      "solution": "<p><img src=\"https:https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/06/Common_Diagram_28.01.2020_D1.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>The logic followed is:</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 360px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Letters</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Positional value</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>double digit positional value changes to single digit</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 30%;\"><strong>Given code</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">G</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">7</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">7</td>\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align: center; width: 20%;\">7 + 2 + 6 + 4 = <strong>19</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">B</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">2</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">2</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">X</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">24</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">2 + 4 = 6</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">D</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">4</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">4</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Similarly,</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 360px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Letters</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Positional value</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>double digit positional value changes to single digit</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Given code</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">L</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">12</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">1 + 2 = 3</td>\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align: center;\">3 + 5 + 9 + 1 = <strong>18</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">N</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">14</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">1 + 4 = 5</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">R</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">18</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">1 + 8 = 9</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">A</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">1</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">1</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is<strong> &quot;18&quot;.</strong></p>\n",
